    "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:17:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-20T13:17:45Z",
    "body": "Expecting toJSON to always return an object would just be a misunderstanding of what the toJSON method is for. It returns a representation of the object suitable for JSON serialization. That can be any JSON-supported value type. I think the spec here is clear enough on this point. ",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
