    "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:51:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-30T10:51:35Z",
    "body": "It's really just the naming, ideally, I would have loved it to be named something like: \"forJSON\", \"forJSONStringify\" or \"toJSONSerialization\" and \"toJSON\" reserved for JSON output of an objects properties.",
